  dialogueLines:
  - "This is the farmer's place \u2014 you can tell by the tools leaning against
    the porch."
  - Rows of crops stretch out just behind the house, though a few patches look a
    little worse for wear.
  - The farmer's usually out at first light and doesn't come back in until the sun's
    low.
